GL-AP1300LTE: {{media:gl.inet:gl-ap1300lte.jpeg?200|GL-AP1300LTE}} 


  * 400Mbps (2.4G) + 867Mbps (5G) Combined Wi-Fi Speed
  * Supports MU-MIMO
  * 2 Gigabit Ports with RJ45 Interface
  * PoE Power Supply
  * Built-in Watchdog
  * built-in nano SIM card slot
  * built-in mini PCIe interchangeable module


