===== Installation =====
Per [[commit>b9389186b012e5bd99ea]] the firmware is installed from uboot TFTP by holding the reset button, connecting power, and waiting until the power led flashes 5 times, and then turns solid. First the factory image is loaded from uboot tftp or web after which the sysupgrade image can be used.

